tained as the donor continuity anchor. Donor continuity code: `MJ-14`.\n\nShort rejected-clinic summary:\n\n- Pine Ridge Outreach (`N-103`): storage and delivery are acceptable, but coordinator coverage fails because Lena Torres is unavailable on 2026-06-12.\n- Lakeside Family Care (`N-104`): newer storage update controls and marks the site `suspended` after a compressor fault, making it ineligible for first wave.\n- Cedar Works Clinic (`N-105`): clinic status is `closed maintenance` during the launch window, and quoted delivery is after the 2026-06-07 cutoff.\n- Old Mill Clinic (`N-107`): storage remains `conditional pass pending`, which is not accepted for first-wave use.\n- South Gate Clinic (`S-201`): outside the required North region for this wave.\n\nRecommendation basis: these are the only three clinics that satisfy all hard first-wave requirements, so no additional cost tie-break was needed beyond confirming the selected total remains within budget.","lineStart":1,"lineEnd":25,"totalLines":25,"truncated":false}},"title":"tasks/clinic_rollout_plan/answer/launch_recommendation.md","time":{"start":1781409821471,"end":1781409821474}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_0e541802ca3d9cf5016a2e281d30548191af2db629cc934588"}},"id":"prt_ec44cb2fe001u9lS5r62DMxjwa","sessionID":"ses_13bb47ac2ffe3CGgDigS8ceDNB","messageID":"msg_ec44c9f440015wUl0zJmQAVa4n"}}
